---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
interface Props {lang:"en"|"pt-br";}
const {lang}=Astro.props;
const pt=lang==="pt-br";
const prefix=pt?"/pt-br":"";
const title=pt?"Banco completo de itens do cliente":"Full client item database";
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={title+" | Atlantica Knowledge Hub"}
  description={pt?"Índice pesquisável dos 23.586 IDs extraídos dos arquivos do cliente Atlantica Global.":"Searchable source index of 23,586 original Atlantica Global game-client item IDs."}
  alternatePaths={{en:"/items/database/", "pt-br":"/pt-br/items/database/"}}>
  <main class="container" id="full-client-db" data-lang={lang}>
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href={prefix+"/items/"}>{pt?"← Catálogo de equipamentos":"← Equipment catalog"}</a></nav>
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">GLOBAL / NA · MINER SNAPSHOT 1</p>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p class="intro">{pt
        ?"Consulta baseada no inventário dos arquivos do jogo. Contém equipamentos, livros, materiais, consumíveis, packs, cosméticos e outros tipos de itens — não apenas os equipamentos das boxes."
        :"An index of original game-client files, including equipment, books, materials, consumables, packs, cosmetics and other item types — not just items found in captured boxes."}</p>
      <p class="caution">{pt
        ?"Nomes, níveis, grades e materiais são dados extraídos do cliente, não garantias de existência no servidor, disponibilidade atual, obtenção ou fabricação. Um mesmo nome pode existir em IDs diferentes. Colisões de identidade permanecem sem nome atribuído."
        :"Names, levels, grades and materials are client-extracted fields, not proof of live-server existence, availability, acquisition or craftability. One English name can belong to different item IDs. Identity collisions remain unnamed."}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="coverage" aria-label={pt?"Cobertura":"Coverage"}>
      <div><strong>23.586</strong><small>{pt?"IDs de origem":"Source IDs"}</small></div>
      <div><strong>22.702</strong><small>{pt?"Nomes conciliados":"Named IDs"}</small></div>
      <div><strong>884</strong><small>{pt?"IDs sem identidade única":"Unresolved IDs"}</small></div>
      <div><strong>27.281</strong><small>{pt?"Definições de arquivo":"Source records"}</small></div>
    </section>

    <section class="search-panel" aria-label={pt?"Pesquisar itens":"Search items"}>
      <div class="search-grid">
        <label>{pt?"Nome em inglês ou ID":"English name or ID"}
          <input type="search" id="db-query" autocomplete="off" placeholder={pt?"Ex.: Spirit Sword, Immortal Bow, 24120":"e.g. Spirit Sword, Immortal Bow, 24120"}/>
        </label>
        <label>{pt?"Categoria original":"Original source category"}
          <select id="db-category"><option value="">{pt?"Todas as categorias":"All categories"}</option></select>
        </label>
        <label>{pt?"Estado da identidade":"Identity status"}
          <select id="db-identity">
            <option value="">{pt?"Todos os IDs":"All IDs"}</option>
            <option value="named">{pt?"Nome identificado":"Official name identified"}</option>
            <option value="collision">{pt?"Nome divergente no mesmo ID":"Conflicting names for ID"}</option>
            <option value="unresolved">{pt?"Sem nome identificado":"No resolved name"}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>{pt?"Ordenação":"Sort by"}
          <select id="db-sort">
            <option value="id">{pt?"ID crescente":"Ascending ID"}</option>
            <option value="name">{pt?"Nome A–Z":"Name A–Z"}</option>
            <option value="level">{pt?"Nível bruto decrescente":"Raw level descending"}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      <label class="equipment-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" id="db-equipment-only"/>
        <span>{pt?"Mostrar somente categorias semelhantes a equipamentos (classificação do cliente, não elegibilidade comprovada)":"Show only equipment-like source categories (not confirmed equip/enhancement eligibility)"}</span>
      </label>

      <section class="stats-workbench" aria-label={pt?"Filtrar atributos de origem":"Filter original numeric attributes"}>
        <h2>{pt?"Atributos numéricos do cliente":"Original client numeric attributes"}</h2>
        <p class="subtle">{pt
          ?"Filtro opcional sobre os 7.560 IDs com atributos de Items.csv. Os arquivos de atributos só são carregados quando você escolher um campo. Limites inclusivos usam valores brutos de +0, sem multiplicadores. Valores ausentes ou conflitantes são excluídos do filtro; valores parciais são identificados na ficha."
          :"Optional filter across 7,560 IDs with Items.csv fields. Numeric shards load only after choosing a field. Inclusive bounds use raw +0 values, never enhancement multipliers. Missing or conflicting fields do not match; partial source values are identified in item details."}</p>
        <div class="stats-grid">
          <label>{pt?"Campo numérico":"Numeric field"}
            <select id="db-stat-field">
              <option value="">{pt?"Sem filtro numérico":"No numeric field filter"}</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>{pt?"Mínimo bruto":"Raw minimum"}
            <input id="db-stat-min" type="number" step="any" placeholder={pt?"Sem mínimo":"No minimum"} disabled/>
          </label>
          <label>{pt?"Máximo bruto":"Raw maximum"}
            <input id="db-stat-max" type="number" step="any" placeholder={pt?"Sem máximo":"No maximum"} disabled/>
          </label>
          <button type="button" id="db-export" disabled>{pt?"Exportar resultados CSV":"Export filtered CSV"}</button>
        </div>
        <p class="subtle" id="db-stat-status" role="status">{pt?"Dados numéricos ainda não carregados.":"Numeric shards have not been loaded."}</p>
      </section>
      <p class="load-status" id="db-status" role="status">{pt?"Carregando índice do cliente…":"Loading client index…"}</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table aria-label={pt?"Todos os itens do cliente":"All client item IDs"}>
          <thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>{pt?"Nome oficial em inglês / estado":"Official English name / status"}</th>
            <th>{pt?"Categoria do arquivo":"Source category"}</th><th>{pt?"Nível bruto":"Raw level"}</th>
            <th>{pt?"Grade bruta":"Raw grade"}</th><th>{pt?"Fontes":"Sources"}</th><th>{pt?"Comparar":"Compare"}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="db-results"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="pagination">
        <button type="button" id="db-prev" disabled>{pt?"Anterior":"Previous"}</button>
        <span id="db-page">—</span>
        <button type="button" id="db-next" disabled>{pt?"Próximo":"Next"}</button>
      </div>
      <section class="compare-workbench" aria-label={pt?"Comparar itens":"Compare items"}>
        <h2>{pt?"Comparar atributos de equipamentos":"Compare equipment source attributes"}</h2>
        <p class="subtle">{pt
          ?"Selecione de 2 a 3 IDs de categorias semelhantes a equipamentos. A comparação mostra apenas números originais, preservando ausência, divergência e cobertura parcial por registro; diferença numérica não indica qual item é melhor."
          :"Select 2–3 equipment-like source IDs. Comparison shows original numeric fields only, preserving missing, conflicting and partial source observations; a numeric difference is not a gameplay ranking."}</p>
        <div class="compare-controls">
          <div id="db-compare-selected" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <button type="button" id="db-compare-run" disabled>{pt?"Comparar selecionados":"Compare selected"}</button>
          <button type="button" id="db-compare-clear" disabled>{pt?"Limpar seleção":"Clear selection"}</button>
        </div>
        <div id="db-compare-result" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </section>
      <noscript>{pt?"Ative JavaScript para pesquisar o índice do cliente. As 551 fichas originais continuam acessíveis no catálogo de equipamentos.":"Enable JavaScript to search the client index. The original 551 item pages remain available from the equipment catalog."}</noscript>
    </section>

    <section class="detail" id="db-detail" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <div class="detail-header"><div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{pt?"REGISTROS DO CLIENTE":"ORIGINAL CLIENT RECORDS"}</p>
        <h2 id="db-detail-name"></h2>
        <p id="db-detail-meta"></p>
      </div><button type="button" id="db-detail-close">{pt?"Fechar":"Close"}</button></div>
      <p id="db-detail-notice" class="detail-note"></p>
      <div id="db-detail-content"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  import {buildHistoricalClientProjection,labelForClientField} from "../data/client-item-stat-summary.mjs";
  import {RAW_STATS_FIELDS,summarizeRawNumericRows,comparableRawNumber,matchesRawStat,
    compareSourceStats,exportFilteredClientCsv} from "../data/full-client-stats-tools.mjs";
  type IndexRow=[string,string|null,string|null,string|null,string|null,number,"named"|"collision"|"unresolved",number,number];
  type SourceRow=[number,string,string,string,string|number|null,string|number|null,number|null,number|null,string,[string,number][]];
  type Detail={s:SourceRow[];v:number[][]};
  type Manifest={snapshotId:number;totalIds:number;namedIds:number;collisionIds:number;unresolvedIds:number;indexShards:string[];detailBucketWidth:number};
  const root=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#full-client-db");
  if(root){
    const pt=root.dataset.lang==="pt-br",prefix=pt?"/pt-br":"";
    const $=<T extends HTMLElement>(id:string)=>root.querySelector<T>("#"+id)!;
    const query=$<HTMLInputElement>("db-query"),category=$<HTMLSelectElement>("db-category");
    const identity=$<HTMLSelectElement>("db-identity"),sort=$<HTMLSelectElement>("db-sort");
    const equipmentOnly=$<HTMLInputElement>("db-equipment-only");
    const statField=$<HTMLSelectElement>("db-stat-field");
    const statMin=$<HTMLInputElement>("db-stat-min"),statMax=$<HTMLInputElement>("db-stat-max");
    const statStatus=$<HTMLParagraphElement>("db-stat-status"),exportButton=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-export");
    const compareSelected=$<HTMLDivElement>("db-compare-selected");
    const compareRun=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-compare-run"),compareClear=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-compare-clear");
    const compareResult=$<HTMLDivElement>("db-compare-result");
    const status=$<HTMLParagraphElement>("db-status"),results=$<HTMLTableSectionElement>("db-results");
    const pageLabel=$<HTMLSpanElement>("db-page"),prev=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-prev"),next=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-next");
    const detail=$<HTMLElement>("db-detail"),details=$<HTMLElement>("db-detail-content");
    const detailName=$<HTMLElement>("db-detail-name"),detailMeta=$<HTMLElement>("db-detail-meta");
    const detailNotice=$<HTMLElement>("db-detail-notice");
    const close=$<HTMLButtonElement>("db-detail-close");
    const namedRows=new Map<string,IndexRow>();
    const detailCache=new Map<number,Promise<Record<string,Detail>>>();
    const statsCache=new Map<number,Promise<Record<string,[number,Record<string,string>][]>|null>>();
    let statsManifestPromise:Promise<{snapshotId:number;itemIds:number;sourceRows:number;files:string[]}|null>|null=null;
    let allStatsPromise:Promise<Map<string,ReturnType<typeof summarizeRawNumericRows>>>|null=null;
    let indexedStats=new Map<string,ReturnType<typeof summarizeRawNumericRows>>();
    let allStatsReady=false,filterEpoch=0,compareEpoch=0;
    const comparedIds:string[]=[];
    // Categories are ORIGINAL ItemType source labels, not proof that the
    // item is equipped or currently enhanceable on the server.
    const equipmentCandidateCategories=new Set([
      "Weapon","Defence","Sword","Spear","Axe","Bow","Gun","Cannon",
      "Staff","Guitar","Saw","Whip","Shield","Orb","Armor","Pants",
      "Boots","Helmet","Glove","Ring","Accessories","Neck","EARRING","BRACELET"
    ]);
    let allRows:IndexRow[]=[],visible:IndexRow[]=[],currentPage=0,manifest:Manifest|null=null;
    const perPage=100,number=new Intl.NumberFormat(pt?"pt-BR":"en-US");
    const statLabels={ActivePower:pt?"Poder ativo":"Active Power",
      BuffUpPercentage:pt?"Bônus de buff (%)":"Buff bonus (%)"} as Record<string,string>;
    const fieldTitle=(key:string)=>statLabels[key]??labelForClientField(key,pt);
    const groupNames={attack:pt?"Ataque":"Attack",defense:pt?"Defesa":"Defense",
      attributes:pt?"Atributos básicos":"Base attributes",other:pt?"Outros":"Other"} as Record<string,string>;
    const label=(key:string)=>({named:pt?"Nome conciliado":"Source name reconciled",
      collision:pt?"Nome divergente entre arquivos":"Identity collision",
      unresolved:pt?"Nome ainda não resolvido":"Name unresolved"} as Record<string,string>)[key]??key;
    const node=(tag:string,text?:string,className?:string)=>{
      const el=document.createElement(tag);
      if(text!==undefined)el.textContent=text;
      if(className)el.className=className;
      return el;
    };
    const td=(tr:HTMLTableRowElement,text:string)=>{const cell=node("td",text);tr.append(cell);return cell;};
    const nameFor=(id:string)=>namedRows.get(id)?.[1]??null;
    const fmtRaw=(x:unknown)=>x===null||x===undefined||x===""?"—":String(x);
    const sourceURL=(id:string)=>`/data/client-items/details/${String(Math.floor(Number(id)/1000)).padStart(2,"0")}.json`;
    async function fetchJSON(url:string){
      const response=await fetch(url,{cache:"force-cache"});
      if(!response.ok)throw Error("Client dataset unavailable");
      return response.json();
    }
    async function sourceDetails(id:string):Promise<Detail>{
      if(!manifest)throw Error("Client manifest unavailable");
      const bucket=Math.floor(Number(id)/manifest.detailBucketWidth);
      if(!detailCache.has(bucket)){
        detailCache.set(bucket,fetchJSON(sourceURL(id)).then(data=>{
          if(data.snapshotId!==manifest?.snapshotId||data.bucket!==bucket||!data.items)
            throw Error("Original client shard mismatch");
          return data.items as Record<string,Detail>;
        }));
      }
      const rows=await detailCache.get(bucket)!;
      if(!rows[id])throw Error("No original source data for ID");
      return rows[id];
    }
    async function numericManifest(){
      if(!statsManifestPromise){
        statsManifestPromise=fetchJSON("/data/client-items/stats/manifest.json")
          .then(data=>{
            if(data.snapshotId!==manifest?.snapshotId||
              data.dataset!=="all-client-item-raw-stats"||
              !Array.isArray(data.files))return null;
            return data as {snapshotId:number;itemIds:number;sourceRows:number;files:string[]};
          }).catch(()=>null);
      }
      return statsManifestPromise;
    }
    async function numericBucket(bucket:number,meta:{files:string[]}){
      const filename=String(bucket).padStart(2,"0")+".json";
      if(!meta.files.includes(filename))return null;
      if(!statsCache.has(bucket)){
        statsCache.set(bucket,fetchJSON("/data/client-items/stats/"+filename)
          .then(data=>{
            if(data.snapshotId!==manifest?.snapshotId||
              data.bucket!==bucket||data.schemaVersion!=="1.0"||
              !data.items||typeof data.items!=="object"||Array.isArray(data.items))
              throw Error("Unrecognized original numeric shard");
            return data.items as Record<string,[number,Record<string,string>][]>;
          }).catch(err=>{statsCache.delete(bucket);throw err;}));
      }
      return statsCache.get(bucket)!;
    }
    async function optionalNumericStats(id:string){
      if(!manifest)return null;
      const meta=await numericManifest();
      if(!meta)return null;
      const bucket=Math.floor(Number(id)/manifest.detailBucketWidth);
      return (await numericBucket(bucket,meta))?.[id]??null;
    }
    async function loadAllRawStats(){
      if(allStatsReady)return indexedStats;
      if(!allStatsPromise){
        allStatsPromise=(async()=>{
          const meta=await numericManifest();
          if(!meta||meta.itemIds!==7560||meta.sourceRows!==9351||meta.files.length!==28)
            throw Error("Numeric source manifest is missing or incompatible");
          // This ~1 MB secondary index loads only after a user explicitly
          // selects a source field. Regular 23,586-ID searches stay light.
          const chunks=await Promise.all(meta.files.map(async filename=>{
            if(!/^[0-2][0-9]\.json$/.test(filename))
              throw Error("Unexpected numeric shard name");
            const bucket=Number(filename.slice(0,2));
            const records=await numericBucket(bucket,meta);
            if(!records)throw Error("Numeric shard unavailable");
            return {bucket,records};
          }));
          const built=new Map<string,ReturnType<typeof summarizeRawNumericRows>>();
          let sourceRows=0;
          for(const {bucket,records} of chunks){
            for(const [id,rawRows] of Object.entries(records)){
              const original=namedRows.get(id);
              if(built.has(id)||!original||original[6]!=="named"||
                Math.floor(Number(id)/1000)!==bucket)
                throw Error("Numeric field source ID does not match client index");
              built.set(id,summarizeRawNumericRows(rawRows));
              sourceRows+=rawRows.length;
            }
          }
          if(built.size!==meta.itemIds||sourceRows!==meta.sourceRows)
            throw Error("Partial or duplicate numeric client data");
          indexedStats=built;
          allStatsReady=true;
          statStatus.textContent=pt
            ?number.format(built.size)+" IDs com atributos carregados. Valores brutos; conflitos preservados."
            :number.format(built.size)+" numeric source IDs loaded. Raw values; conflicts preserved.";
          return built;
        })().catch(err=>{
          allStatsPromise=null;
          statStatus.textContent=pt
            ?"Não foi possível validar os arquivos numéricos. Tente novamente."
            :"Could not validate numeric client shards. Please retry.";
          throw err;
        });
      }
      return allStatsPromise;
    }
    function addRawNumericSourceTable(parent:HTMLElement,rawRows:[number,Record<string,string>][]) {
      // Source evidence may include book/material/etc categories; ZERO is
      // never replaced with an assumed missing field, and conflicts are not
      // silently averaged or resolved.
      const summary=summarizeRawNumericRows(rawRows);
      parent.append(node("h3",pt?"Atributos numéricos originais — Items.csv":"Original numeric client attributes — Items.csv"));
      parent.append(node("p",pt
        ?"Dados extraídos do cliente, não conferidos no servidor. Zero, ausência, cobertura parcial e divergência entre registros são situações diferentes. Campos com divergência não são usados como um valor único."
        :"Client-extracted values, not measured on the server. Zero, missing, partial coverage and conflicting source rows are different states. Conflicting fields are never treated as one canonical value.","detail-note"));
      for(const group of ["attack","defense","attributes","other"]){
        const fields=RAW_STATS_FIELDS.filter(f=>f.group===group&&summary.fields.has(f.key));
        if(!fields.length)continue;
        const section=node("section",undefined,"numeric-group");
        section.append(node("h4",groupNames[group]));
        const table=node("table") as HTMLTableElement;
        const head=node("thead"),heading=node("tr");
        for(const label of [pt?"Campo original":"Original field",pt?"Valor(es) bruto(s)":"Raw value(s)",
          pt?"Cobertura e situação":"Coverage and status"])heading.append(node("th",label));
        head.append(heading);table.append(head);
        const body=node("tbody");
        for(const f of fields){
          const stat=summary.fields.get(f.key)!;
          const row=node("tr");
          if(stat.status==="conflict")row.className="numeric-conflict";
          row.append(node("td",fieldTitle(f.key)+" ("+f.key+")"));
          row.append(node("td",stat.values.join(" / ")));
          const situation=stat.status==="conflict"?(pt?"Divergente":"Conflicting"):
            stat.status==="partial"?(pt?"Parcial":"Partial"):(pt?"Consistente":"Consistent");
          row.append(node("td",stat.observedIn+"/"+stat.sourceCount+" · "+situation));
          body.append(row);
        }
        table.append(body);
        const wrap=node("div",undefined,"stat-table-scroll");wrap.append(table);
        section.append(wrap);parent.append(section);
      }
      const sourceRows=node("details",undefined,"numeric-original-rows");
      sourceRows.append(node("summary",pt
        ?"Ver cada registro original e os números exatos"
        :"Inspect each original source row and its exact numbers"));
      const table=node("table") as HTMLTableElement,head=node("thead"),tr=node("tr");
      for(const name of [pt?"Registro de origem":"Source row",pt?"Campo":"Raw field",pt?"Valor":"Raw value"])
        tr.append(node("th",name));
      head.append(tr);table.append(head);
      const body=node("tbody");
      for(const [sourceRow,raw] of rawRows){
        for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(raw)){
          const row=node("tr");
          row.append(node("td","#"+sourceRow));
          row.append(node("td",fieldTitle(key)+" ("+key+")"));
          row.append(node("td",String(value)));
          body.append(row);
        }
      }
      table.append(body);const wrap=node("div",undefined,"stat-table-scroll");
      wrap.append(table);sourceRows.append(wrap);parent.append(sourceRows);
    }
    function addHistoricalGradeTable(parent:HTMLElement,rawRows:[number,Record<string,string>][]) {
      const model=buildHistoricalClientProjection({sourceRows:rawRows.map(([sourceRowNumber,fieldsRaw])=>({
        sourceRowNumber,fieldsRaw,
      }))});
      if(model.rows.length!==11)return;
      const scalable=model.fields,baselineOnly=model.baselineOnlyFields??[];
      const fixed=model.fixedFields.map((field:{key:string})=>field.key);
      const cols=[...scalable,...baselineOnly,...fixed];
      if(!cols.length)return;
      const heading=node("h3",pt?"Progressão +0 a +10 — modelo histórico":"Enhancement +0 to +10 — historical model");
      parent.append(heading);
      parent.append(node("p",pt
        ?"SIMULAÇÃO. +0 = valores brutos de Items.csv; +1 a +10 = multiplicadores históricos somente em ataque, AC e atributos básicos. Defesa mágica, evasão e velocidade de movimento permanecem FIXAS. Isso não comprova que o equipamento possa ser aprimorado. Nenhum grau L é inferido."
        :"MODEL ONLY. +0 = raw Items.csv client data; +1..+10 = historical factors for attack, physical AC and base stats only. Magic Defense, EV and MoveSpeed remain FIXED. Upgrade eligibility is not proven. No Legendary grade is inferred.","detail-note"));
      const table=node("table") as HTMLTableElement;
      const head=node("thead"),headRow=node("tr");
      headRow.append(node("th",pt?"Grau":"Grade"));
      for(const key of cols){
        const label=labelForClientField(key,pt) +
          (fixed.includes(key)?" =":baselineOnly.includes(key)?" (+0)":" ×");
        headRow.append(node("th",label));
      }
      headRow.append(node("th",pt?"Origem":"Basis"));head.append(headRow);table.append(head);
      const body=node("tbody");
      for(const row of model.rows){
        const tr=node("tr");tr.append(node("td","+"+row.grade));
        for(const key of cols)tr.append(node("td",String(row.values[key]??"—")));
        tr.append(node("td",row.grade===0?(pt?"Extraído":"Client raw"):(pt?"Estimativa":"Estimated")));
        body.append(tr);
      }
      table.append(body);
      const scroller=node("div",undefined,"stat-table-scroll");scroller.append(table);parent.append(scroller);
      if(model.fixedConflicts?.length)parent.append(node("p",pt
        ?"Campos fixos divergentes não foram projetados: "+model.fixedConflicts.join(", ")
        :"Conflicting fixed fields omitted: "+model.fixedConflicts.join(", "),"subtle"));
    }
    function linkItem(id:string,title:string){
      const a=node("a",title) as HTMLAnchorElement;
      a.href="?id="+encodeURIComponent(id);
      a.addEventListener("click",event=>{
        if(event.ctrlKey||event.metaKey||event.shiftKey||event.altKey)return;
        event.preventDefault();void openItem(id,true);
      });
      return a;
    }
    function updateComparisonSelection(){
      compareEpoch++;
      compareSelected.replaceChildren();
      compareSelected.append(node("span",(pt?"Selecionados: ":"Selected: ")+
        comparedIds.length+"/3","subtle"));
      for(const id of comparedIds){
        const chip=node("span",undefined,"compare-chip");
        chip.append(linkItem(id,nameFor(id)??("ID "+id)));
        const remove=node("button",pt?"Remover":"Remove") as HTMLButtonElement;
        remove.type="button";remove.setAttribute("aria-label",(pt?"Remover ID ":"Remove ID ")+id);
        remove.addEventListener("click",()=>toggleComparison(id));
        chip.append(remove);compareSelected.append(chip);
      }
      compareRun.disabled=comparedIds.length<2;
      compareClear.disabled=comparedIds.length===0;
      compareResult.replaceChildren();
    }
    function toggleComparison(id:string){
      const row=namedRows.get(id);
      if(!row||row[6]!=="named"||
        !equipmentCandidateCategories.has(row[2]??""))return;
      const position=comparedIds.indexOf(id);
      if(position>=0)comparedIds.splice(position,1);
      else if(comparedIds.length<3)comparedIds.push(id);
      updateComparisonSelection();
      renderPage();
    }
    async function runComparison(){
      if(comparedIds.length<2)return;
      const selected=[...comparedIds],token=++compareEpoch;
      compareRun.disabled=true;
      compareResult.replaceChildren(node("p",pt
        ?"Carregando registros originais para comparação…"
        :"Loading original source records for comparison…","subtle"));
      try{
        // Only selected item buckets are requested, never the full 28-shard
        // numeric index. Comparison is available without running filters.
        const source=await Promise.all(selected.map(id=>optionalNumericStats(id)));
        if(token!==compareEpoch)return;
        const summaries=source.map(rows=>rows?summarizeRawNumericRows(rows):null);
        const observed=RAW_STATS_FIELDS.filter(f=>
          summaries.some(summary=>summary?.fields.has(f.key)));
        if(!observed.length){
          compareResult.replaceChildren(node("p",pt
            ?"Nenhum desses IDs possui valores numéricos publicados."
            :"None of these IDs has published numeric source fields.","subtle"));
          return;
        }
        const scroller=node("div",undefined,"stat-table-scroll"),table=node("table") as HTMLTableElement;
        table.className="compare-table";
        const head=node("thead"),headers=node("tr");
        headers.append(node("th",pt?"Atributo original":"Original field"));
        for(const id of selected){
          headers.append(node("th",(nameFor(id)??("ID "+id))+" · #"+id));
        }
        headers.append(node("th",pt?"Amplitude bruta":"Raw spread"));
        head.append(headers);table.append(head);
        const body=node("tbody");
        for(const {key} of observed){
          const stat=compareSourceStats(summaries,key);
          if(!stat)continue;
          const row=node("tr");
          row.append(node("td",fieldTitle(key)+" ("+key+")"));
          for(const item of stat.values){
            const value=item.record;
            const cell=node("td");
            if(!value)cell.textContent="—";
            else{
              cell.textContent=value.values.join(" / ");
              if(value.status!=="consistent"){
                cell.append(node("small",value.status==="conflict"
                  ?(pt?" · divergente":" · conflict")
                  :(" · "+(pt?"parcial ":"partial ")+value.observedIn+"/"+value.sourceCount)));
              }
            }
            row.append(cell);
          }
          row.append(node("td",stat.difference===null?"—":
            number.format(stat.difference)));
          body.append(row);
        }
        table.append(body);scroller.append(table);
        compareResult.replaceChildren(node("p",pt
          ?"Amplitude = maior valor bruto − menor valor bruto, apenas quando todos os registros concordam. Não é uma classificação de eficiência."
          :"Spread = maximum minus minimum raw value, only when all source records agree. This is not a gameplay efficiency ranking.","subtle"),scroller);
      }catch{
        if(token===compareEpoch)compareResult.replaceChildren(node("p",pt
          ?"Não foi possível carregar os registros originais para comparação."
          :"Original numeric rows could not be loaded for comparison.","subtle"));
      }finally{
        if(token===compareEpoch)compareRun.disabled=comparedIds.length<2;
      }
    }
    function renderPage(){
      results.replaceChildren();
      const start=currentPage*perPage;
      for(const row of visible.slice(start,start+perPage)){
        const tr=node("tr") as HTMLTableRowElement;
        const id=String(row[0]);
        td(tr,id);
        const nameCell=td(tr,"");
        if(row[6]==="named"){
          nameCell.append(linkItem(id,row[1]??id));
          if(row[8]===1)nameCell.append(node("small",pt?" · Ficha revisada":" · Reviewed item page"));
        }else{
          nameCell.append(node("span",label(row[6]),"unresolved"));
          nameCell.append(" ",linkItem(id,pt?"Ver estado do ID":"Inspect ID status"));
        }
        td(tr,row[2]??"—");td(tr,fmtRaw(row[3]));td(tr,fmtRaw(row[4]));td(tr,String(row[5]));
        const choose=td(tr,"");
        if(row[6]==="named"&&equipmentCandidateCategories.has(row[2]??"")){
          const selected=comparedIds.includes(id);
          const button=node("button",selected?(pt?"✓ Selecionado":"✓ Selected"):(pt?"Adicionar":"Add")) as HTMLButtonElement;
          button.type="button";button.className="compare-row-button";
          button.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(selected));
          button.setAttribute("aria-label",(selected?(pt?"Remover comparação: ":"Remove from comparison: "):
            (pt?"Adicionar à comparação: ":"Add to comparison: "))+(row[1]??id));
          button.disabled=!selected&&comparedIds.length>=3;
          button.addEventListener("click",()=>toggleComparison(id));
          choose.append(button);
        }else choose.textContent="—";
        results.append(tr);
      }
      prev.disabled=currentPage===0;
      next.disabled=start+perPage>=visible.length;
      pageLabel.textContent=visible.length
        ?`${number.format(start+1)}–${number.format(Math.min(start+perPage,visible.length))} / ${number.format(visible.length)}`
        :"0";
    }
    function applyFilters(){
      const epoch=++filterEpoch;
      const text=query.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase(),cat=category.value,state=identity.value;
      const field=statField.value;
      statMin.disabled=!field;statMax.disabled=!field;
      const minText=statMin.value.trim(),maxText=statMax.value.trim();
      const min=field&&minText!==""?Number(minText):null;
      const max=field&&maxText!==""?Number(maxText):null;
      if(field&&((min!==null&&!Number.isFinite(min))||
        (max!==null&&!Number.isFinite(max))||
        (min!==null&&max!==null&&min>max))){
        visible=[];currentPage=0;renderPage();exportButton.disabled=true;
        status.textContent=pt
          ?"Limites inválidos: o mínimo deve ser menor ou igual ao máximo."
          :"Invalid bounds: minimum must not exceed maximum.";
        return;
      }
      if(field&&!allStatsReady){
        visible=[];currentPage=0;renderPage();exportButton.disabled=true;
        status.textContent=pt
          ?"Carregando os 28 arquivos de atributos numéricos…"
          :"Loading 28 original numeric shards…";
        void loadAllRawStats().then(()=>{
          if(epoch===filterEpoch)applyFilters();
        }).catch(()=>{
          if(epoch===filterEpoch){
            status.textContent=pt
              ?"Falha ao carregar atributos: a consulta não foi aplicada."
              :"Failed to load attributes: numeric filtering was not applied.";
          }
        });
        return;
      }
      visible=allRows.filter(row=>
        (!text||row[0].includes(text)||(row[1]??"").toLocaleLowerCase().includes(text)) &&
        (!cat||row[2]===cat)&&(!state||row[6]===state)&&
        (!equipmentOnly.checked||equipmentCandidateCategories.has(row[2]??"")) &&
        (!field||matchesRawStat(indexedStats.get(row[0]),field,min,max)));
      if(sort.value==="name")visible.sort((a,b)=>(a[1]??"~").localeCompare(b[1]??"~","en")||Number(a[0])-Number(b[0]));
      else if(sort.value==="level")visible.sort((a,b)=>{
        const aa=a[3]===null?null:Number(a[3]),bb=b[3]===null?null:Number(b[3]);
        if(aa===null)return bb===null?Number(a[0])-Number(b[0]):1;
        if(bb===null)return -1;
        return bb-aa||Number(a[0])-Number(b[0]);
      });
      currentPage=0;renderPage();
      exportButton.disabled=visible.length===0;
      status.textContent=pt
        ?number.format(visible.length)+" dos "+number.format(allRows.length)+" IDs encontrados. "+number.format(manifest?.namedIds??0)+" nomes conciliados."
        :number.format(visible.length)+" of "+number.format(allRows.length)+" IDs found. "+number.format(manifest?.namedIds??0)+" reconciled names.";
    }
    function addDefinitionTable(parent:HTMLElement,data:Detail,id:string){
      const h=node("h3",pt?"Definições dos arquivos de origem":"Original source-file definitions");parent.append(h);
      parent.append(node("p",pt
        ?"Arquivos gerais/específicos e agrupamentos de origem não significam, necessariamente, variantes jogáveis. Nível e grade são campos brutos."
        :"General/specific files and source record groupings do not necessarily mean playable item variants. Level and grade are raw fields.","subtle"));
      for(const row of data.s){
        const [recordId,file,role,cat,level,grade,work,unit,state,materials]=row;
        const card=node("section",undefined,"definition");
        card.append(node("h4",`${file} · #${recordId}`));
        const meta=node("p",`${role} · ${cat} · ${pt?"nível bruto":"raw level"} ${fmtRaw(level)} · ${pt?"grade bruta":"raw grade"} ${fmtRaw(grade)} · Work ${fmtRaw(work)} · Unit ${fmtRaw(unit)}`);
        card.append(meta);
        if(materials.length){
          const table=node("table") as HTMLTableElement;
          const head=node("thead"),headRow=node("tr");
          for(const label of [pt?"Material / ID":"Material / ID",pt?"Quantidade":"Quantity"]){headRow.append(node("th",label));}
          head.append(headRow);table.append(head);
          const body=node("tbody");
          for(const [itemId,quantity] of materials){
            const tr=node("tr"),name=td(tr,"");
            name.append(linkItem(itemId,nameFor(itemId)??`ID ${itemId}`));
            td(tr,number.format(quantity));body.append(tr);
          }
          table.append(body);card.append(table);
        }else{
          card.append(node("p",state==="unsupported"
            ?(pt?"Expressão de materiais não decodificada":"Material expression not parsed")
            :(pt?"Nenhuma lista estruturada de materiais no arquivo":"No structured material list in this file"),"subtle"));
        }
        parent.append(card);
      }
      if(data.v.length>1){
        parent.append(node("p",(pt?"Grupos de registros de origem":"Source record groupings")+": "+
          data.v.map((v,i)=>`${i+1}: ${v.map(id=>"#"+id).join(", ")}`).join(" · "),"subtle"));
      }
    }
    async function openItem(id:string,navigate:boolean){
      if(!/^\d{1,12}$/.test(id))return;
      const row=namedRows.get(id);
      if(!row){
        detail.hidden=false;details.replaceChildren();
        detailName.textContent=pt?`ID ${id} não encontrado`:`ID ${id} not found`;
        detailNotice.textContent="";detailMeta.textContent="";
        if(navigate)history.pushState({},"","?id="+encodeURIComponent(id));
        return;
      }
      detail.hidden=false;details.replaceChildren();
      detailName.textContent=row[1]??`Item ID ${id}`;
      detailMeta.textContent=`ID ${id} · ${row[2]??"—"} · ${pt?"fontes":"sources"}: ${row[5]}`;
      detailNotice.textContent=row[6]==="named"
        ?(pt?"Os dados abaixo vêm dos arquivos do cliente e não comprovam obtenção ou fabricação atual.":"These are game-client records, not proof of current acquisition or craftability.")
        :(pt?"Nome retido: identidade divergente ou tradução não resolvida. Nenhuma definição foi atribuída a um nome inventado.":"Name withheld: conflicting identity or unresolved translation. No source record was assigned a guessed name.");
      if(navigate)history.pushState({},"","?id="+encodeURIComponent(id));
      if(row[8]===1){const p=node("p");const a=node("a",pt?"Abrir ficha completa do equipamento":"Open full equipment profile") as HTMLAnchorElement;
        a.href=prefix+"/items/"+id+"/";p.append(a);details.append(p);}
      if(row[6]!=="named"){
        details.append(node("p",label(row[6]),"subtle"));detail.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});return;
      }
      details.append(node("p",pt?"Carregando os registros de origem…":"Loading original source records…","subtle"));
      try{
        const data=await sourceDetails(id);
        // Do not let an earlier slow request overwrite a more recent selection.
        if(new URL(location.href).searchParams.get("id")!==id)return;
        details.replaceChildren();
        if(row[8]===1){const p=node("p");const a=node("a",pt?"Abrir ficha detalhada do equipamento (+0 a +10)":"Open detailed equipment article (+0 through +10)") as HTMLAnchorElement;
          a.href=prefix+"/items/"+id+"/";p.append(a);details.append(p);}
        addDefinitionTable(details,data,id);
        // Original raw numeric rows are shown for every named item type.
        // Only equipment-like source categories may use the explicitly
        // unverified historical upgrade projection.
        const rawStats=await optionalNumericStats(id);
        if(new URL(location.href).searchParams.get("id")!==id)return;
        if(rawStats){
          addRawNumericSourceTable(details,rawStats);
          if(equipmentCandidateCategories.has(row[2]??""))
            addHistoricalGradeTable(details,rawStats);
        }else if(equipmentCandidateCategories.has(row[2]??"")&&row[8]!==1){
          details.append(node("p",pt
            ?"Atributos de combate ainda não foram importados para este ID. Não é possível calcular +0 a +10 com segurança sem os valores originais de Items.csv."
            :"Combat attributes for this ID have not yet been imported. +0..+10 cannot be calculated safely without the original Items.csv values.","subtle"));
        }
      }catch{
        details.replaceChildren(node("p",pt?"Não foi possível carregar o arquivo deste ID.":"Could not load the client source shard for this ID.","subtle"));
      }
      detail.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});
    }
    close.addEventListener("click",()=>{
      detail.hidden=true;details.replaceChildren();history.pushState({},"",location.pathname);
    });
    window.addEventListener("popstate",()=>{
      const id=new URL(location.href).searchParams.get("id");
      if(id)void openItem(id,false);else detail.hidden=true;
    });
    query.addEventListener("input",applyFilters);
    category.addEventListener("change",applyFilters);
    identity.addEventListener("change",applyFilters);
    sort.addEventListener("change",applyFilters);
    equipmentOnly.addEventListener("change",applyFilters);
    statField.addEventListener("change",applyFilters);
    statMin.addEventListener("input",applyFilters);
    statMax.addEventListener("input",applyFilters);
    exportButton.addEventListener("click",()=>{
      if(!visible.length||statField.value&&!allStatsReady)return;
      const csv=exportFilteredClientCsv(visible,{
        pt,field:statField.value,summaries:indexedStats,
      });
      const blob=new Blob([csv],{type:"text/csv;charset=utf-8"});
      const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a=node("a") as HTMLAnchorElement;
      a.href=url;a.download="atlantica-client-items-snapshot-1.csv";
      a.click();
      window.setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),2500);
    });
    compareRun.addEventListener("click",()=>{void runComparison();});
    compareClear.addEventListener("click",()=>{
      comparedIds.splice(0);updateComparisonSelection();renderPage();
    });
    updateComparisonSelection();
    prev.addEventListener("click",()=>{if(currentPage>0){currentPage--;renderPage();}});
    next.addEventListener("click",()=>{if((currentPage+1)*perPage<visible.length){currentPage++;renderPage();}});
    (async()=>{
      try{
        manifest=await fetchJSON("/data/client-items/manifest.json") as Manifest;
        if(manifest.snapshotId!==1||manifest.totalIds!==23586||manifest.namedIds!==22702||manifest.indexShards.length!==6)
          throw Error("Manifest incompatible with original Miner snapshot");
        const pieces=await Promise.all(manifest.indexShards.map(file=>
          fetchJSON("/data/client-items/"+file)));
        allRows=pieces.flatMap(data=>{
          if(data.snapshotId!==manifest?.snapshotId||data.schemaVersion!=="1.0"||!Array.isArray(data.rows))
            throw Error("Client index shard mismatch");
          return data.rows as IndexRow[];
        });
        if(allRows.length!==manifest.totalIds)throw Error("Incomplete client item ID coverage");
        const categoryValues=new Set<string>(),seen=new Set<string>();
        for(const row of allRows){
          if(seen.has(row[0])||!/^\d+$/.test(row[0]))throw Error("Duplicate client item identity");
          seen.add(row[0]);namedRows.set(row[0],row);
          if(row[2])categoryValues.add(row[2]);
        }
        for(const cat of [...categoryValues].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,"en"))){
          const opt=node("option",cat) as HTMLOptionElement;opt.value=cat;category.append(opt);
        }
        for(const {key} of RAW_STATS_FIELDS){
          const opt=node("option",fieldTitle(key)+" ("+key+")") as HTMLOptionElement;
          opt.value=key;statField.append(opt);
        }
        applyFilters();
        const deepLink=new URL(location.href).searchParams.get("id");
        if(deepLink)void openItem(deepLink,false);
      }catch{
        status.textContent=pt?"Falha ao carregar ou validar o índice completo. Confira os dados publicados.":"Could not load or verify the full client index. Check the published source data.";
      }
    })();
  }
</script>
<style>
  .container{width:min(var(--content-width),94%);margin:0 auto;padding-bottom:90px}
  .breadcrumb{padding:22px 0}.breadcrumb a,.detail a{color:var(--color-accent)}
  header{margin-bottom:24px}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.1rem);margin:8px 0 16px}
  .eyebrow{letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--color-accent)}
  .intro{color:var(--color-text);line-height:1.7;max-width:900px}
  .caution,.detail-note{border-left:3px solid var(--color-bronze);background:var(--color-surface);
    padding:12px 15px;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .coverage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,180px),1fr));gap:12px;margin:22px 0}
  .coverage>div{border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:15px;border-radius:5px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  .coverage strong{font-size:1.55rem;color:var(--color-gold-light);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .coverage small{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .search-panel{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:25px}
  .search-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,190px),1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px}
  label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:.87rem;color:var(--color-gold-light)}
  input,select{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--color-border);background:var(--color-surface);
    color:var(--color-text);border-radius:5px;padding:11px;font:inherit}
  .equipment-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.86rem}
  .equipment-toggle input{width:auto;cursor:pointer}
  .stats-workbench,.compare-workbench{margin:18px 0 22px;padding:16px;
    border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .stats-workbench h2,.compare-workbench h2{font-size:1.17rem;margin:0 0 8px;
    color:var(--color-gold-light)}
  .stats-workbench .subtle,.compare-workbench .subtle{font-size:.87rem;margin:8px 0 15px}
  .stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(200px,2fr) repeat(2,minmax(120px,1fr)) auto;
    gap:12px;align-items:end}
  .stats-grid button{min-height:43px}
  .stats-grid input:disabled{opacity:.48}
  .compare-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #db-compare-selected{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;flex:1 1 280px}
  .compare-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius:4px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:.87rem}
  .compare-chip a{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .compare-chip button,.compare-row-button{font-size:.78rem;padding:5px 8px}
  .compare-row-button[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--color-accent);color:var(--color-gold-light)}
  .numeric-group{margin:18px 0}
  .numeric-group h4{color:var(--color-gold-light);margin:8px 0}
  .numeric-conflict{outline:1px solid var(--color-bronze);outline-offset:-1px}
  .numeric-original-rows{margin:20px 0;cursor:pointer}
  .numeric-original-rows summary{color:var(--color-accent);padding:8px 0}
  .compare-table small{display:block;color:var(--color-text-muted);white-space:nowrap}
  .load-status{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:5px}
  table{width:100%;min-width:760px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.88rem}
  th,td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:10px 12px;text-align:left}
  thead th{background:#29271f;color:var(--color-gold-light)}
  tbody tr:hover{background:var(--color-surface)}
  .unresolved{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  td small{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  td a{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .pagination{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:18px 0 30px}
  button{cursor:pointer;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:4px;
    color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface)}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}
  .detail{margin:25px 0;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:5px;
    background:var(--color-surface)}
  .detail[hidden]{display:none}
  .detail-header{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between}
  .detail-header h2{font-size:1.55rem;margin:0;color:var(--color-gold-light)}
  .detail-header p{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .definition{border:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:14px 0;border-radius:4px;padding:13px;background:var(--color-background)}
  .definition h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--color-gold-light);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .definition p{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .definition table{min-width:300px}
  .stat-table-scroll{overflow:auto;margin:16px 0;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:4px}
  .stat-table-scroll table{min-width:800px;white-space:nowrap}
  .subtle{color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  @media(max-width:860px){.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.detail{padding:12px}.coverage{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
    .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.compare-controls{align-items:stretch}}
</style>